  {
    "id": 1014001050010,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050020,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甘奈、頑張らなくっちゃ……だもんね\r\nファンのみんなに甘奈のいいとこ見せたいし……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（これぐらい大きな規模のイベントだと、\r\nさすがに甘奈も緊張するか……）",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（何か声をかけて安心させてあげたいな……）",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈、そんなに緊張しなくてもいいんだぞ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050030,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "プロデューサー……\r\n甘奈、緊張しているように見えてた？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ、ちょっと珍しいなと思って見ていた",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050040,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そっか……\r\n実は……ね。笑わないで聞いてほしいんだけど……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甜花ちゃんと輝きたい！　甘奈が本気でアイドルしたい！\r\nって思うようになってから",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050060,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "急に失敗するのが怖くなっちゃったんだー\r\nえへへ。らしくない、かな？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことないさ\r\nそれは、甘奈が成長したってことだからな",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050070,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そうなの、かな？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈はアイドルとしてのポテンシャルが高いから、\r\n失敗らしい失敗をしてこなかったよな",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050080,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "自分では意識したことなかったけど……\r\nそうだったかも",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから、甘奈なら普段通りやれば乗り越えられるんだ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050090,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "わかってるよ、普段通りにやればいいって\r\nわかってるけど……こんなに緊張するのは初めてなんだもん",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050100,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ホントに甘奈にできる、かな？\r\n失敗しちゃわないかな？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050100"
  },
  {
    "select": "甜花は\r\n戦い続けてきたぞ",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "甘奈はひとりじゃない",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "初心にかえればいい",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050110,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……そうだよね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最近はひとりでの自主レッスンも多くこなしている\r\n不安を抱きながらも、頑張っているんだ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050120,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん、最近の甜花ちゃん……ホントすごいよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050130,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "戦い続けてるから\r\nあんなに輝けてるんだよね！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\nなら……甘奈は、どうする？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050140,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……どうする……かぁ\r\nそんなの、１つしかないよね",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050150,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甜花ちゃんと一緒に輝きたいもん！\r\n甘奈だって頑張るよっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050160,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "見ててね、プロデューサーさん\r\n絶対成功させてくるから！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050170,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "え……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈はさ、最初からなんでもできる子だったよな",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だからこそいつか\r\n壁にぶつかる日が来るんじゃないかって思っていたんだ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それが今なんじゃないか？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050180,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……うん、そうかも",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050190,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "でも……大丈夫なんだよね？\r\n甘奈はひとりじゃないから",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ、そうだ\r\n甘奈には甜花や千雪がいるからな",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050200,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "それに……プロデューサーさんだっているもんね？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あぁ！　もちろん俺もいるさ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050210,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへ、なんかちょっと力が湧いてきたかも\r\n失敗するの、怖くなくなってきたよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だろ？\r\n甜花だって仲間がいるから頑張れているんだぞ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050220,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん、そうだよね\r\nみんながいてくれるから甘奈、頑張れるんだ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050230,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ありがとう、プロデューサーさん！\r\n甘奈、行ってくるね！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050230"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈が今、気負ってしまっているのは、\r\n本気でアイドルをやりたいって思っているからだろ？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050240,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん、そうかも\r\n甜花ちゃんと一緒に輝きたいって思ったから……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも最初は、そんなことなかっただろ？\r\nステージ前、どんなこと思っていた？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050250,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えーと、楽しみーとか、みんなに楽しんでほしい！\r\nとかかな？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050250"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050260,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "いつもどきどき、わくわく！ってしてたよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その気持ち、今思い返してみないか？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050270,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……うん！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうだ？　思い返せたか？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050280,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……うん……ステージやイベントは、\r\n最初のころからずっと楽しかったな",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "たしかに、甘奈は楽しそうにしていたよ\r\nだからこそ、お客さんも楽しんでいてくれていたよな",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050290,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん\r\n甘奈、楽しくないときなんかなかった",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050290"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050300,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……あ、そーか\r\n今から、楽しいことが待ってるってことなんだ",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050300"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050310,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "だよね？　プロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そのとおりだ！",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050320,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ、甘奈\r\nめっちゃ大切なこと、忘れてたみたいだね",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050320"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001050330,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "思い出せたのは、プロデューサーさんのおかげだよ！\r\nステージ、サイコーに楽しんでくるね☆",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400105/1014001050330"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]